  m_Name: Dragon
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  exhibitName: The Elder Scrolls Blades Ancient Dragon
  description: 'The Elder Scrolls Blades Ancient Dragon is a very powerful dragon
    that appears in the mobile game The Elder Scrolls: Blades. It is one of the toughest
    enemies players can face, usually found in special quests and in the Abyss. Ancient
    Dragons come in two types: fire and frost, and they can breathe deadly elemental
    attacks. They are very large, winged reptiles and are considered legendary creatures
    in the Elder Scrolls universe. Ancient Dragons are iconic in Elder Scrolls lore,
    representing the ultimate challenge for players who want to test their skills
    against one of the most fearsome monsters in the game. '
  audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 725622310794ce944b77da79a6739314, type: 3}
